    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44235" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sīlānus</span></b> ,
		i, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιληνός</span>, Doric <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιλανός</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a fountain</i>
			or <i>jet of water</i> (usually spirting from a head
